# A registration whose hop is refused still lands its descriptors.
MODULE: RegistrationAllOrNothingPartialCommit
TARGET: RegistrationAllOrNothing
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a refused registration commits the half that merged
PERTURBS: Register

--- FIND
    /\ rtD' = IF ok THEN rtD \cup (a.d \ HostD) ELSE rtD
--- REPLACE
    /\ rtD' = IF ok \/ a.h # {} THEN rtD \cup (a.d \ HostD) ELSE rtD
--- END